{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10100141","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10100141","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:8:1010014101:0":{"text":"불을 끄는 것보다 방화범이 누군지에 더 관심이 있는 거지?","source_cn":"比起灭火，你们对纵火者是谁更感兴趣，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E74004FCFC067E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010014102:0":{"text":"이 방화범! 당신이 마법을 부리는 걸 내 두 눈으로 직접 봤어!","source_cn":"纵火犯，我亲眼看到你在施法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197908E1B4F52D43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010014103:0":{"text":"탐욕스럽게 타오르는 불을 막는 건 쉬운 일이 아니라고. 이봐, 난 그저 막아보려고 노력한 것뿐이었어.","source_cn":"让一团贪婪燃烧的火停下来可没那么容易，亲爱的，我只是在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1768676AB24DB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010014104:0":{"text":"화염의 마녀의 아름다운 외모만큼 그녀의 화염 또한 위험하기 그지없다지... \n젠장, 역시 소문대로군...","source_cn":"灰烬魔女有多美丽，她的火焰就有多危险……\\n真见鬼，果...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A95BCCF2F586399","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010014105:0":{"text":"위험하다고? 그래, 당신 말이 맞아. \n만약 이게 내 화염이었다면 당신들은 벌써 잿더미가 되고도 남았을 테니까! 하하하...","source_cn":"危险？你说的没错。\\n如果这是我的火焰，你、你们，早是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B5F96A1F6FF4A28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010014106:0":{"text":"화염의 마녀였군요. 마스터님, 치피도 들어본 이름이에요.","source_cn":"原来她就是灰烬魔女。主人，满满听过她的名号。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x996E6606A6EE166A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"화염의 마녀였군요. 마스터님, 치피도 들어본 이름이에요.","female":"화염의 마녀였군요. 마스터님, 치피도 들어본 이름이에요.","variant_male_record_index":"96349","variant_female_record_index":"96350","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010014107:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1010014108:0":{"text":"당신은...","source_cn":"你是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11835C31A8DA83DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1010014109:0":{"text":"음?!\n마스터, 만약 치피가 잘못 본 게 아니라면... 화염의 마녀가... 마스터를 노려보는 것 같은데요? ","source_cn":"咦？！\\n主人，如果满满没看错的话……灰烬魔女好像……...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB87029818FCAAD8A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"음?!\n마스터, 만약 치피가 잘못 본 게 아니라면... 화염의 마녀가... 마스터를 노려보는 것 같은데요? ","female":"음?!\n마스터, 만약 치피가 잘못 본 게 아니라면... 화염의 마녀가... 마스터를 노려보는 것 같은데요? ","variant_male_record_index":"96352","variant_female_record_index":"96353","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1010014110:0":{"text":"어떡하죠? 정말 마스터를 노려보고 있어요!","source_cn":"怎么办啊主人？她真的在盯着您！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF946182D914D666","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떡하죠? 정말 마스터를 노려보고 있어요!","female":"어떡하죠? 정말 마스터를 노려보고 있어요!","variant_male_record_index":"96354","variant_female_record_index":"96355","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1010014110":{"text":"어떡하죠? 정말 마스터를 노려보고 있어요!","source_cn":"怎么办啊主人？她真的在盯着您！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF946182D914D666","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떡하죠? 정말 마스터를 노려보고 있어요!","female":"어떡하죠? 정말 마스터를 노려보고 있어요!","variant_male_record_index":"96354","variant_female_record_index":"96355","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1010014111:0":{"text":"아... 아니, 사람을 잘 못 봤군.","source_cn":"……没什么，我认错人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D31B47085920A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1010014112:0":{"text":"점괘가 아주 딱 맞아떨어졌네. 오늘은 안 좋은 일이 유난히도 많은 날이야. 외출을 하지 말았어야 했는데.","source_cn":"占卜的结果一点也没错，这是个多灾多难的夜晚，我不该出门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0495920B86B64D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1010014113:0":{"text":"이제 다들 날 좀 내버려 둬. 그만 가봐야겠으니까.","source_cn":"可以的话，还请各位别再叨扰我，我想离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FF4AA97966E6457","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1010014114:0":{"text":"화염의 마녀! 내 물건이 다 타버렸다고요! 갈 때 가더라도 배상은 하고 가야죠!","source_cn":"灰烬魔女，你不能走！我的货物全都被烧毁了，我需要补偿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x519BF17CB46D4C9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1010014115:0":{"text":"꼬마야, 적당히 하렴. 내 인내심엔 한계가 있단다.","source_cn":"可不要得寸进尺哦，小弟弟，我不是一个很有耐心的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645626EA1FFA1225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1010014116:0":{"text":"도망치려 하지 마요. 끝까지 쫓아갈 거니까요!","source_cn":"你别想逃脱罪责，我一定会追究到底！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF4E6D4904F7B458","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1010014117:0":{"text":"쉿... 조용. \n주변의 상황이 심상치 않은 것 같아.","source_cn":"嘘……你先安静点。\\n这周围的情况似乎不太对劲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB80DAFAF7F172873","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1010014118:0":{"text":"바람이... 갑자기 시끄러워졌군.","source_cn":"风……忽然很喧嚣呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE940C3228B554E5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:0:1":{"text":"(그녀의 시선을 피한다)","source_cn":"（避开她的目光）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x096B871202DDC805","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(그녀의 시선을 피한다)","female":"(그녀의 시선을 피한다)","variant_male_record_index":"58502","variant_female_record_index":"58503","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:1:2":{"text":"(그녀를 의심스러운 눈초리로 바라본다)","source_cn":"（向她投去质疑的眼神）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x043F265B0C18F458","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(그녀를 의심스러운 눈초리로 바라본다)","female":"(그녀를 의심스러운 눈초리로 바라본다)","variant_male_record_index":"58504","variant_female_record_index":"58505","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:36:1010023:0":{"text":"화재 현장에 가보니 마을 사람들이 붉은 머리의 마녀와 싸우고 있었다.","source_cn":"你们来到火灾中心，看见村民们正在和一位红发魔女争执。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE4D7A377FE6BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:红发魔女":{"text":"빨간 머리 마녀","source":"红发魔女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:愤怒的女村民":{"text":"분노한 주민","source":"愤怒的女村民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:愤怒的男村民":{"text":"분노한 남자 주민","source":"愤怒的男村民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:生气的小男孩":{"text":"화난 남자 아이","source":"生气的小男孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":5}}